来归其妻，故曰归妻。”迨，及，趁。见摽有梅注。泮（pàn），融化。按泮是判的假借字。说文：“判，分也。”毛传：“泮，散也。”分散在这里都是指冰融化。陈奂传疏：“未泮，犹在解冻前也。”古代人结婚多在秋冬两个季节举行，荀子大略：“霜降迎女，冰泮杀止。”姚际恒诗经通论：“古人行嫁娶必于秋冬农隙之际，故云‘迨冰未泮’。”左传襄公二十二年：“十二月，郑游贾将归晋，未出竟（境），遭逆（迎）妻者，夺之。”可见春秋时民间嫁娶亦在秋冬。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"篇序","title":"这是一位女子在济水岸边等待未婚夫时所唱的诗，前人多曲…","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0002","order":2,"layerLabel":"篇序","title":"姚际恒言此诗“四章各自立义，不为连类之辞。”（诗经通…","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0003","order":3,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"匏有苦叶，济有深涉。深则厉，浅则揭。","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0003-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0004","order":4,"layerLabel":"字词注","title":"匏有苦叶","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0004-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0005","order":5,"layerLabel":"字词注","title":"济有深涉","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0005-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0006","order":6,"layerLabel":"字词注","title":"深则厉","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0006-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0007","order":7,"layerLabel":"字词注","title":"浅则揭","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0007-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0008","order":8,"layerLabel":"全篇总说","title":"匏有苦叶，济有深涉。深则厉，浅则揭。","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0008-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0009","order":9,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"有瀰济盈，有鷕雉鸣。济盈不濡轨，雉鸣求其牡。","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0009-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0010","order":10,"layerLabel":"字词注","title":"有瀰济盈","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pao-you-ku-ye/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0010-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0011","order":11,"layerLabel":"字词注","title":"有鷕雉鸣","href":"/shijing/gloss/034-pa